---
// src/components/NowWidget.astro
---

<section class="rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 bg-bg-surface border border-border-subtle hover:border-accent/30 transition-colors shadow-sm">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
      <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-emerald-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.7)]"></span>
      </span>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg">
        Current Focus / Now
      </h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono text-fg-muted">Updated August 2026</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm">
    <!-- Item 1 -->
    <div class="space-y-1.5 p-4 rounded-xl bg-bg-elevated/50 border border-border-subtle/70 hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent font-semibold block uppercase tracking-wider">
        Currently Building
      </span>
      <p class="font-medium text-fg">CropCare (Mobile App)</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        On-device ML plant diagnosis in Flutter with offline Drift SQLite and FastAPI backend sync.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Item 2 -->
    <div class="space-y-1.5 p-4 rounded-xl bg-bg-elevated/50 border border-border-subtle/70 hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent font-semibold block uppercase tracking-wider">
        Strengthening Fundamentals
      </span>
      <p class="font-medium text-fg">Mobile & Applied AI</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        Deepening Flutter, TensorFlow Lite, and applied AI workflows through Ascentic's AI Launchpad.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Item 3 -->
    <div class="space-y-1.5 p-4 rounded-xl bg-bg-elevated/50 border border-border-subtle/70 hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-sm hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-200">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent font-semibold block uppercase tracking-wider">
        Target Direction
      </span>
      <p class="font-medium text-fg">Industry Standards</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
        Adopting robust software engineering practices, clean architecture, and professional development workflows.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
